 "remarks": "Rare Land Offering in the Rowayton Beach Association  An exceptional opportunity to build your dream home in one of Rowayton's most sought-after coastal communities. This desirable parcel of land, also available for purchase with the existing property, offers the opportunity to create a custom coastal retreat just steps from the water.  Enjoy the exclusive amenities of the Rowayton Beach Association, including private beach access, community grills, and Adirondack chairs perfectly positioned to take in sweeping views of Long Island Sound. The iconic neighborhood boathouse serves as a welcoming hub for social gatherings and offers a convenient place to launch your kayak or paddleboard. Whether you envision a timeless seaside residence or a modern coastal escape, this rare land offering presents a unique opportunity to bring your vision to life in a coveted Rowayton location.",
